  "version": "1.0",
  "title": "Fleet: dashcam event to driver coaching",
  "subtitle": "A triggered video event is uploaded and scored; severe events alert a dispatcher, coachable events go to a safety review and a coaching session.",
  "description": "Vehicle edge: a telematics trigger makes the dash camera save an event clip, which is uploaded and scored by an AI triage service and stored. A severe event alerts the dispatcher, who makes a welfare check with the driver. A safety reviewer reviews stored events; non-coachable events are dismissed. Coachable events are assigned to the fleet manager, who schedules a coaching session with the driver and records the outcome.",
